# --- PyInstaller staging (regenerated by scripts/build_engine.sh/.ps1) ---
# This is the whole point of Phase 1's architecture: the frozen engine
# executable is a build OUTPUT, platform-specific and often 80MB+, not
# something to commit. Run the build script locally (or in CI, once per
# target OS/arch) before packaging the Compose Desktop app.
composeApp/src/desktopMain/resources/engine-dist/

